Subject: [PATCH] runtime: indexed exact LRU and event-driven idle-pool reclamation

Hits update an indexed recency list without tree allocations. Reused slots carry
insertion generations; byte accounting evicts before addition to avoid overflow.
Only a returned pool can make the idle list require another reclamation scan.

